JavaScript
-----------
  ->javascript is a scripting language as well as programming language
  ->Js is dynamically typed programming(means it is valid for any variables..e.g u can store any type of dta like int,boolean,float etc)
  ->Js having a single call stack


Uses:
----
   ->using js we can add functionalities to web pages
   ->using js we can build dynamic web applications
   ->here we can achieve DOM(Document  Obeject Model) functonalities using that we can manipulate HTML and CSS
   ->We can Fetch data from server(API's) and also send data to server (API's)

